WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Xiao Huihui is fried

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:18,580
What happened?

3
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:22,040
Xiao Huihui, I’ll give you delicious meat

4
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:24,080
There is such delicious garbage in the world

5
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,440
Youyou also thinks it’s heaven

6
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,400
Hey hey hey

7
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,280
Fourth Young Master Yang Zhigan is all well

8
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,640
When did I say I wanted to eat?

9
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,170
Brother, what is this?

10
00:00:31,170 --> 00:00:32,970
Youyou has never eaten it before

11
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:35,010
What a little country bumpkin who has never seen the world.

12
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:37,020
Let it go

13
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,940
Miss Youyou, do you want me to feed you?

14
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,820
No need. Youyou can eat it by yourself.

15
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,020
Thank you, sister. Youyou likes sister the most.

16
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,620
Miss Youyou, if you like

17
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:45,940
I will do it for you every day from now on

18
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,100
Is this true?

19
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,760
Hmm hmm

20
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:52,130
Brother, Youyou, help you stir it up.

21
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:53,050
Okay

22
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:56,900
The best food is for my favorite brother

23
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:02,100
Where did you learn the local flavor?

24
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,250
Not bad indeed

25
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:05,890
Fourth Young Master, Miss Youyou

26
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:07,650
This is the express delivery from Er Shao

27
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:10,130
It says it is a gift for Miss Youyou

28
00:01:10,130 --> 00:01:13,410
So familiar smell

29
00:01:13,410 --> 00:01:17,730
Pieces sent

30
00:01:17,730 --> 00:01:20,380
Brother is so nice. Youyou likes it very much.

31
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:23,480
Hey hey hey madam

32
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:25,920
Miss Youyou is well-raised

33
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,240
You have spirit in heaven

34
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:30,040
I will definitely be happy for Miss Youyou too.

35
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,880
Third brother, second brother and two scheming dogs

36
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:34,860
Give her a gift without saying a word to her

37
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:38,150
Is it a big deal to have a black card? Okay?

38
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:42,170
It's a bit miserable

39
00:01:42,170 --> 00:01:43,530
I’m the only one in the whole family who doesn’t have one

40
00:01:43,530 --> 00:01:51,780
What kind of poisonous tricks does the little brat have?

41
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:54,360
How did she know she was going to give her a gift?

42
00:01:54,360 --> 00:02:00,150
My brother bought it for me

43
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:04,840
Yoyo is my favorite in the world today

44
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:07,060
She is the best brother

45
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:08,140
then what am i
